# Nissa, Leyline Tamer: "this ability has resolved this turn" counts the turn, not the game. A Forest on turn 3 is the
# first landfall of that turn and reveals a Llanowar Elves; a Forest on turn 5 is the first landfall of the new turn and
# reveals another, so two Elves stand beside Nissa after two turns of one land each.

